{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgLR2XtrUpPDsd25B4j2h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is PR #3792, \"(fix) O3-6100: Prevent duplicate vitals saves\", merged as commit `0e06523b` on 2026-10-13. It changes one line in the exported vitals form workspace, line 225: `createOrUpdateVitalsAndBiometrics(` becomes `return createOrUpdateVitalsAndBiometrics(`.\n\nBefore the fix, the save handler didn't return the request promise, so react-hook-form's `handleSubmit` treated the submit as finished immediately. `isSubmitting` went back to false while the first request was still pending, and the \"Save and close\" button's `disabled={!hasUserUnsavedChanges || isSubmitting}` (line 677) stopped disabling it. With the return, `isSubmitting` stays true until the save settles, so a second click is ignored. If the save fails, the form keeps the entered values and the user can retry, as the PR summary describes.\n\nThe PR also adds 71 lines of tests in `vitals-biometrics-form.test.tsx`, which I did not inspect. The diff I checked is against the commit's first parent. The file contents are from Falkon at the merge commit, not from the local checkout.\n\nEvidence, best first:\n\n- Fix commit: `0e06523b` (the PR's merge commit)\n- Fix PR: #3792\n- Ticket: O3-6100\n- Changed line: `exported-vitals-biometrics-form.workspace.tsx:225`, the `return` added to the save call\n- Button disabled condition that the fix relies on: `exported-vitals-biometrics-form.workspace.tsx:677`\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart\", \"commit\": \"0e06523b799319ec65716df66eafb32aef170b3c\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart\", \"pr\": 3792},\n  {\"ticket\": \"O3-6100\"},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart/packages/esm-patient-vitals-app/src/vitals-biometrics-form/exported-vitals-biometrics-form.workspace.tsx\", \"startLine\": 225, \"endLine\": 225},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart/packages/esm-patient-vitals-app/src/vitals-biometrics-form/exported-vitals-biometrics-form.workspace.tsx\", \"startLine\": 673, \"endLine\": 681}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":33630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":851},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b8351378-838b-46be-b400-054953198f93","uuid":"5bce6dcc-5392-4f5b-a77d-fa4c5793b0b4","timestamp":"2026-10-24T04:16:23.637Z","request_id":"req_011CgLR2XeDr7vAryc4MeRZq"}
